    @*
        CSS CASCADE ORDER — Decision #12 §12.4 (SPEC: 00.2-THEMING-ARCHITECTURE.md)
         1. 00-baseline.css — structural tokens
         2. Existing layout/module CSS
         3. Theme: brand → mode-light → mode-dark
         4. admin.css (Phase 1-2 Modified Big Bang; removed Phase 3)
         5. lipi-inputs.css — Phase 2.2 Batch 3 shared input-family base styles
         6. lipi-compound.css — Phase 2.3 Batch 9a compound-field visual primitives
         7. lipi-multi.css — Phase 2.3 Batch 9b multi-select chip / summary / search input
         8. lipi-selection-family.css — Phase 2.5 LipiCheckbox/Radio/Toggle family rules (incl. LabelPosition grid)
         9. lipi-form-utilities.css — Phase 2.5 form-row utility patterns
        10. lipi-tabs.css — Phase 2.6.1 LipiTabs layout (3 variants × state matrix)
        11. lipi-alerts.css — Phase 2.6.1 LipiAlert layout (5 severities × 4 styles)
        12. lipi-cards.css — Phase 2.6.1 LipiCard layout (5 variants + sub-components)
        13. lipi-overlays.css — Phase 2.6.2 LipiModal + LipiDrawer layout + animations
        14. lipi-dynamic-tabs.css — Phase 2.6.2 LipiDynamicTabs tab strip layout
        15. lipi-skeleton.css — Phase 2.7 LipiSkeleton family (3 shape primitives + shimmer)
        16. lipi-validation.css — Phase 2.7 LipiValidationSummary field-flash keyframe (global scope)
        17. Blazor CSS Isolation bundle (LiPi.Web.styles.css)

        CACHE VERSION HISTORY (reverse-chronological)
        | Version  | Phase / Batch                       | What shipped                                        |
        |----------|-------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
        | 20260526 | Phase 2.7 — CHANGE-LOG A35           | Phase 2.7 Feedback Components: LipiSpinner, LipiBadge, LipiPill, LipiSkeleton (3), LipiValidationSummary, LipiToast family. Token additions (--color-danger-text-strong + 7 Phase 2.7 component tokens). LipiToastHost wired into TopNavLayout. ILipiToastService registered Scoped. |
        | 20260525 | Phase 2.6.2 — CHANGE-LOG A30–A34    | Phase 2.6.2 close-out: LipiModalTypes recovery (A30), LipiModal declarative family (A31), bug sweep + drawer pin completion (A32), StyleGuideOverlays 30-demo rewrite (A33), DynamicTabs chevron overflow redesign (A34) |
        | 20260524 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A27         | LipiCard spec reconciliation: interactivity unified on IsInteractive; accent radius + focus-ring + aria to spec |
        | 20260523 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A26         | LipiCard CSS self-sufficiency: optional-token fallbacks (border-tertiary, sh-xs) |
        | 20260522 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A25         | LipiAlert critical header aligned to the alert family's icon+text rhythm |
        | 20260521 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A24 (corr.) | LipiAlert critical body left-inset — moved to scoped file (20260520 attempt was overridden) |
        | 20260520 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A24         | LipiAlert critical body align — first attempt, shared-file rule overridden (superseded by 20260521) |
        | 20260519 | Phase 2.6.1 — CHANGE-LOG A23         | LipiAlert critical header strip alignment fix (margin-top, gutter, line-height) |
        | 20260518 | Phase 2.6.x — CHANGE-LOG A22 (cont.) | lipi-tabs.css active-underline zoom fix: thickness = underline-width + overlap |
        | 20260517 | Phase 2.6.x — CHANGE-LOG A22         | lipi-tabs.css self-sufficiency: optional-token fallbacks (active-underline zoom fix superseded by 20260518) |
        | 20260516 | Phase 2.6.3 Stage 1C                | Wire missing lipi-selection-family + form-utilities |
        | 20260516 | Phase 2.6.3 Stage 1A (earlier)      | Wire missing 2.6.x CSS + lipi-overlay-interop.js    |
